# ============================================================
# Bubble Catcher - Environment Configuration
# ============================================================
#
# This project uses a MONOREPO structure. Environment variables
# are configured per package:
#
#   backend/.env       Backend (Bun + Elysia) configuration
#   frontend/.env      Frontend (SvelteKit) configuration
#
# Follow these steps:
#
# 1. Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env
#    Configure Supabase URL, anon key, and JWT secret
#
# 2. Copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env
#    Configure Supabase public URL and anon key
#
# ============================================================

# No environment variables are configured at the root level.
# See backend/.env.example and frontend/.env.example for details.
